    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It's been a long time, Buldrokkas'tee."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Dame, Kal'tsit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Why don't... you age?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Shieldguards. Guerrillas. Stand by. Hold position."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Roger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Lord."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The way you talk... is that because of an infected organ in your larynx?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "No. Just, over time, became like this. I can't, speak smoothly, anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Dame... I never thought, I'd see you, again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I remember, faintly. When my people, left. You and, Her Majesty, didn't stop us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That was a long, long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I was, in my prime. Now I know, too sudden. I was wrong, about the King."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...You'll still call her 'Majesty' and 'King.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "A king, is a king."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "When I left, she wasn't. Now, she has passed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You still distinguish the King of Kazdel and the Emperor of Ursus."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Decorum. War does not, muddle, my thoughts. Who I served? All gone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Ursus now, is my homeland, too. My liege, buried in Ursus. Vast land."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "...To long, Dame. When we left..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "My people were, not yet withered. Still, it was not, long."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But you... no change. The years, did not change you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Not true. The years have changed us all, Buldrokkas'tee. I'm not the same woman I was before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Buldrokkas'tee... why did you leave Kazdel?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Why I left, I think, you will laugh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I left, because, I hated killing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "...But for my life, I have killed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "All that you've been through has only tempered your will. Your blood still flows in your veins. I will not laugh at you. You've earned respect."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "High praise, Dame. I failed to avoid, killing. I did, kill so many."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Dame, this name... Do you know, how I got it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Your followers consider you a true warrior, fighting for Ursus. You fight injustice, slavery, bloodshed and oppression for the future of Ursus."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Do you agree?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "(Shakes his head)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Even if war, is necessary, such a title, is trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "For many, we started war. But war, is murder."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "The war ends. If it, truly, ends. We should, all die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But war never ends."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But I will die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But, for my death, I want, meaning. I want to see, for Ursus, for the Infected, another future."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I asked, many times, of my people, Kazdel. You and, Her Majesty, worked together, for many years. She trusted you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "So, I too, trust you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You led, Rhodes Island, here. Not for blood."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "...But them, those two. They stink, of my daughter. Her death."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Me? And... Amiya...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mr. Patriot..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "FrostNova died to test us\u2014",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "No. No more."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Do you seek vengeance on Rhodes Island, Patriot?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "No, Dame. Not vengeance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Why take, vengeance, for her, actions?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "That was, her path. She chose. No matter, where it ended."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Your daughter fought us with everything she had!;She was strong.;FrostNova had an iron will.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "And she approved of us too.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "...What?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Mr. Patriot?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "She's, so young. Only knows, blind trust."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "The truth, we believed, in the end, is exposed. Only a few, wolves, in sheep's clothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You...!",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mr. Patriot! Miss FrostNova gave her life, her Arts... everything..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Miss FrostNova let go of everything just to prove herself, her anger, her ideals..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Her life had meaning!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Enough. Not your place, to say this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Amiya, don't. Say no more.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "What, do you know?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "If my daughter, was not, terminal... Killing you, would be easy, for her. Like slicing wheat, with a sickle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "What you, endured, I do not care."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "It means, nothing. It proves, nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Talulah has set the core city on a collision course for Lungmen!",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "And is she, declaring it, Ursus territory?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "How did you know?!;......;Seems like we can skip that part.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Patriot... how... then why...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "The puppetmaster, has many tools. Puppetmasters, think alike."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But I cannot, let you through. Reunion, cannot destroy, itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I won't, betray again. Or they, the Infected, the struggle, are for nothing. They die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Even if, Talulah, has gone mad..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "How do I tell, the Infected, their leader, is mad? A traitor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "How do I say, she is wrong now, but once right? How do I say, she, who you follow, must now die?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I won't let, Reunion, become 'Infected, civil war, then nothing.' I will not."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But Reunion won't be able to carry its own weight. And besides, Talulah has been working secretly to destroy Reunion from within."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You are right, Dame Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "And so, you are here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I prepared, to face, many types of foe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But I did not, expect, in the end, to fight Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...Is this really what you choose?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Buldrokkas'tee... You don't have to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Choose? I have only, one choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "To kill you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Patriot, we don't need to throw more lives away! This isn't like it was with Miss FrostNova! No matter who wins, this battle is playing right into the enemy's hands!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Cautus, this, is war."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You want me, to stop. Why, should I stop?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I fought far, too many wars."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "As the, Wendigo, of Ursus... barbarians. Flayers, ripped flesh from bone, vicious herds, we cleansed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Monsters. Twisted, stinking limbs, eyes in the, hundreds. Fingers in, the thousands. We slaughtered."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Warriors. Victoria, with steam armor. Kazimierz, with Silverlance Pegasi. Laterano, with Apostolic, Gun-Knights. All of them, we defeated, utterly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But we cannot, defeat ourselves. Cannot defeat, the Empire's greed. Cannot defeat, our people's deaths."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "We, the Wendigos, are the Sarkaz, closest, to death."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You are stained, with my daughter's death."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "In this world, there are fates, worse than death."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Why should I stop? Who dares, test me? My virtue?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "They called me, righteous. Should I, accept?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Fate thinks me weak. Do I suffer it? They called me strong. Should I bear it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Traitor, rebel, butcher, guardian..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "All of them, like 'Patriot.' On the battlefield, they are nothing, but scraps."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You killed her. I'll kill you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "It is not, revenge. I have no heart, for vengeance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "My daughter just, gave up the fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "No!;......;That's not how it is, sir.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "If not, then how? She gave her life, and you still live?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I, will not, give up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I only know, what I see. I only know, what I hold."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I don't fight you, for my daughter."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "...But I loathe fate."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I will fell it, crush it, grind it to dust."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "If fate, lets you, make me turn."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I would rather, never turn, back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "...Captain! Are you really going to...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Anyone who, thinks me, dishonorable. Stand now, challenge me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But if you, value your life... We part, here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I don't want, for you, a foolish death. I won many times. I know this, too well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You can't..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Buldrokkas'tee, don't be stupid, you can live on."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Dame, you too, have tasted loss."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "And so, could you, stand by, and watch?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014You\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "My blood, no longer, serves her. Yes. My country... is Ursus."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "But when she, died. We heard it... that long, long gasp."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "So you could feel it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That was the moment with the pulse containing her Arts spread through the body of every Sarkaz in the world."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It was only an instant. But you felt it. That means your blood... is ancient enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "So ancient that, I am alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I never thought, born in Kazdel, never Infected... Then, an old man, I tasted it, Oripathy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Is that right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "We all know, Dame. We all know. Things in this world, do not happen, because they are, right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "In fact, most things, are mistakes, again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "My men said, I can fix them. In fact, they are too many. There is no, looking back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Do you fight, to this day, for what, you lost, Dame?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I think, no."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I think, you lost, and you refuse, to lose more."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_025_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "My daughter, has passed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "\u2014I fight not, for her death. I fight, for the living, for all Infected, to the end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Reunion, cannot fail."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Reunion must, liberate. All Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 3,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Are you sending messages for him and his men?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "What will you say to him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_059",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...You're trying to set up the guerrillas. You're... you're going to turn the Ursus Infected against them, to kill them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "You know they won't raise a hand against the civilians."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_059",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Hate is the strongest weapon. It's a killer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "But he won't die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He's Patriot... he's all the greatest legends summed up in one man. I've seen his armor. I've seen him swing a weapon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He can't die! He and his people are the strongest fighters in all Reunion!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "You want to kill the Infected. You devils never cared about life, but he does!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He's Ursus... he's Sarkaz, and he's Infected! But none of those qualities push him to do wrong!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He's not just Ursus, he's not just Sarkaz, he's not just an Infected. He's the Patriot, just the Patriot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He'll beat you, he'll block your attacks, spit on your insults, regroup the Infected, and cleanse their hate..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "He's Patriot, and he won't die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "And you're a bunch of maggots, dancing on the strings of the disgusting schemers running this show."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You're talking like that because you know you're gonna die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "And you're definitely right about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Patriot's pretty tough. But you're not. You're gonna die."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
