        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 3,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "So you, will not pass. I will not, allow it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "To go through, central district, you have to, kill me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Otherwise, my guerrillas, will hunt. And I, will be here, strangling you, to death."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You will die, at my hands."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Only if, you kill me, will your value, be known. Otherwise, you are only, intruders."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "What's wrong with you?!;...How unreasonable.;I'm afraid I don't really follow.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Of course, I don't believe, you have any, value."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I don't know, how you could, resist, my people's, witchcraft. But you will not, survive, Ursus tactics."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You really hate us that much?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I don't hate, anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I just don't, trust you. I cannot, trust."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Even you, Lord. You brought..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You won't approve of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I don't believe, in coincidences."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "War."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "War, does not care. Not about right, or wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "It does not, care about, the suffering, or the oppressed, or the enslaved. Off the battlefield, there are. On the battlefield, there are not."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "You must prepare, for the battlefield."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Whoever dies, is wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I can't... I can't understand him...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "What is he saying... why do we have to fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Fight, or be crushed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Resist, and be crushed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "Unless, you defeat, me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "If fate, stands with me, I kill you. Then I, shall kill it. So it cannot, mock anyone, ever again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "If fate, stands with you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I can only, go forward. Advance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "All operators, fall back, immediately!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_025_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patriot",
        "text": "I step forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Our target is an Infected commander of the Reunion movement, code name: 'Patriot.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "His armor, his strength, his stature, far surpass anything you would expect of a warrior."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Originium may have taken over many of his physiological functions. The Originium in what was once his larynx... is a product of the high rate of crystallization happening inside his body."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That's the most we've been able to gather from our intel."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have reason to believe that a typically fatal wound will not do any significant damage to him, as the Originium will grow and replace tissue damage!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Wendigos naturally exhibit an extremely high metabolic and repair capacity. And from where we stand, we don't know whether his infection is causing him pain, or is a benign mutation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But no matter how resilient he may be, we have to kill him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Only by killing him can we get through the central district, reach the bridge, and stop the enemy's exploitation of Reunion!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "His guards have been confused by his actions. This is our last chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "What's happening?;...Why?;How did it come to this?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...We're just a fork in his road. All that we've built means nothing to him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We're a choice just like 'go kill Talulah right now.' But I think that one carries more weight to him, might be worth further investigation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "To put it frankly, he's looking down on us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Even with Dr. Kal'tsit here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even the Emperor of Ursus himself couldn't get him to bow his head, let alone me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We'll have to use his death... to open his eyes, and make him see all that we've done, and make him realize that we're stronger than him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But there's no way he himself could ever... change. Everything else, all that you value, is too fragile for him. It can't bear his weight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Hellagur from Azazel misjudged this Sarkaz's character."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...No matter how noble Buldrokkas'tee may be, no matter how much he carries on his shoulders, he is an indomitable warrior, first and foremost."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "FrostNova trusted you, so she gave the last bit of her life to you... But Patriot does not."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "He doesn't trust. He only trusts himself."
    },
    {
